{"id":3859,"date":"2023-09-23T05:53:25","date_gmt":"2023-09-23T05:53:25","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/?p=3859"},"modified":"2026-08-04T08:19:11","modified_gmt":"2026-08-04T08:19:11","slug":"how-to-become-flutter-developer","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-flutter-developer\/","title":{"rendered":"How to Become a Flutter Developer? Full Roadmap 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>The world of app development is constantly evolving and changing, and it&#8217;s essential to stay up-to-date with the current tools and technologies to succeed in this fast-paced industry. One of the most exciting developments in app development in recent years is Flutter, Google&#8217;s open-source UI toolkit to build beautiful, natively compiled web, mobile, and desktop apps from a single code base.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Flutter is a popular topic in the industry, and many companies seek developers. If you want to learn how to develop Flutter apps, this Flutter developer roadmap blog is for you. This blog will help you know where to start and become a Flutter developer. Let&#8217;s begin!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/flutter-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=Content_Banner&amp;utm_campaign=SEO&amp;utm_page=how-to-become-flutter-developer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"250\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/online-flutter-course.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6526\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/online-flutter-course.webp 1000w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/online-flutter-course-300x75.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/online-flutter-course-768x192.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/online-flutter-course-150x38.webp 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Become a Flutter Developer?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>To become a Flutter developer, you need to have a strong foundation in Dart <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-programming-languages\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">programming language<\/a>, knowledge of the Flutter framework, experience in mobile app development, and a willingness to learn and grow. You can achieve all of these with an <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/flutter-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogInterlink&amp;utm_campaign=traffic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">online Flutter course<\/a> by WsCube Tech.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Following this Flutter dev roadmap, you can develop the skills and knowledge required to become a successful developer and build high-quality mobile apps that delight and inspire users.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Many people who aim to learn Flutter will directly start with Flutter, which is a wrong choice for a fresher. First, you must understand the basics of how Flutter was built and what is the foundation of this particular framework.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Start with the basics<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>To understand flutter, it was built using dart language. Dart, a primary programming language, is used to create Flutter applications. Start by learning the basics of Dart, including variables, functions, and classes.<\/p>\n\n\n\n    <!-- LOTTIE SCRIPT -->\n    <script src=\"https:\/\/unpkg.com\/@lottiefiles\/lottie-player@latest\/dist\/lottie-player.js\"><\/script>\n\n    <section class=\"wscube-courses mb-2\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h3 class=\"mb-4\">Recommended Professional <\/br> Certificates<\/h3>\n\n            <div class=\"owl-carousel courseOwl\">\n\n                \n                    \n             